<title>USA: US cash DAP, ammonia prices flat, trade lackluster.</title>
<headline>US cash DAP, ammonia prices flat, trade lackluster.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash diammonium phosphate (DAP) and ammonia prices were unchanged Friday in lackluster dealings, cash sources said.</p>
<p>Market watchers continued to anticipate an increase in dealer purchases before the spring planting season begins.</p>
<p>			  Dlrs/short ton	 Chg from Wednesday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	  176-178		     unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf    188-189		     unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf	  220-225		     unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
